(* eh2-control-all-broken.pv - the NEGATIVE CONTROL. Everything leaks after the
   sessions: identity keys, ephemerals and ML-KEM keys. SK is then computable,
   and ProVerif MUST find it (both queries FALSE). If this file ever proves
   secrecy, the leak plumbing above is broken and the PQ files prove nothing. *)
query attacker(secretI) phase 1.
query attacker(secretR) phase 1.

process World | LeakStatics | LeakEphemerals | LeakKem
